# Encrypt everything in this directory by default, so a new file can't be
# committed in plaintext by accident. Exceptions must be listed explicitly:
# git-crypt needs .gitattributes readable, and sops files are encrypted by
# sops itself (.sops.yaml only holds public age keys).
* filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
.gitattributes !filter !diff
.sops.yaml !filter !diff
secrets.yaml !filter !diff
